# Binary Block — Phase 1.1

Read `docs/binary-block/PHASES.md`. **Current: Phase 1.1 (core foundation).**

## Scope

- `games/binary-mosaic/core/` — UI-free `board` · `rules` · `pieces` · `level` · `session`
- `games/binary-mosaic/ui/` — React only (calls core for place/rotate)
- Dependency: `board → rules → level/session → (future solver → analyzer → generator)`

## Forbidden

Firebase · Google login · ranking · network · Creator Mode · solver · generator · analyzer · Luna · new npm deps · rewriting AudioManager

## Capacity

No unused stubs for solver/generator · keep puzzle adapters thin · do not reverse core dependency direction
